Show the value of x after each of the following statements is performed:
  a) x = fabs( 7.5 );
  b) x = floor( 7.5 );
  c) x = fabs( 0.0 );
  d) x = ceil( 0.0 );
  e) x = fabs( -6.4 );
  f) x = ceil( -6.4 );
  g) x = ceil( -fabs( -8 + floor( -5.5 ) ) );

